WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.530 --> 00:00:05.860
- Just for the record, there's
not one person in this group

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:08.920
that I would have chosen
for this type of mission.

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:10.411
They're all too reckless.

00:00:10.411 --> 00:00:13.161
(dramatic music)

00:00:15.109 --> 00:00:16.999
(somber music)

00:00:16.999 --> 00:00:19.183
- The government has killed
hundreds of families.

00:00:19.183 --> 00:00:21.330
(woman screaming)

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:24.010
Many more will die if
something is not done.

00:00:26.820 --> 00:00:29.110
- What do you know about
what's happening in Ethiopia?

00:00:29.110 --> 00:00:30.540
- It's another bloody genocide

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:32.420
and nobody gives a shit
because it's in Africa.

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:36.758
- Well, your prime minister
decided to give a shit.

00:00:36.758 --> 00:00:39.104
(beating music)

00:00:39.104 --> 00:00:40.680
The Red Sea Diving Resort.

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:43.010
It's a hotel we could use
to smuggle the refugees

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:44.560
through Sudan to Israel.

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:47.723
(airplane engine roaring)

00:00:47.723 --> 00:00:49.179
- So, let's be very clear.

00:00:49.179 --> 00:00:52.300
(beating music)

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:56.520
If this goes wrong, you'll
all be hanging from cranes.

00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:59.187
(beating music)

00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:03.233
- [Man] Mesu?

00:01:04.380 --> 00:01:06.071
- Best cover we could ask for.

00:01:06.071 --> 00:01:08.750
(dramatic music)

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:10.000
- Ace is on the way home.

00:01:13.495 --> 00:01:15.193
- There are still hundreds
crossing the border every week.

00:01:17.521 --> 00:01:20.104
(somber music)

00:01:22.041 --> 00:01:26.954
- It's gonna all right.

00:01:26.954 --> 00:01:28.613
- [Soldier] We are watching you.

00:01:28.613 --> 00:01:29.805
(car engine revving)

00:01:29.805 --> 00:01:32.405
- If you ask me, this entire
country is a tinderbox.

00:01:33.570 --> 00:01:35.470
- The mission isn't
over for us, I promise.

00:01:35.470 --> 00:01:37.073
- This is not a mission for me.

00:01:38.020 --> 00:01:39.000
This is my life.

00:01:40.175 --> 00:01:41.008
(gun cocking)

00:01:41.008 --> 00:01:43.200
- They're executing
dissidents, it's revolution.

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:44.841
- We must leave now.

00:01:44.841 --> 00:01:46.260
(dramatic music)

00:01:46.260 --> 00:01:47.160
- They're dying.

00:01:47.160 --> 00:01:47.993
And they're sick,

00:01:47.993 --> 00:01:49.101
and they're starving.

00:01:49.101 --> 00:01:51.725
(dramatic music)

00:01:51.725 --> 00:01:52.670
- [Man] Is it a roadblock?

00:01:52.670 --> 00:01:53.590
- Full speed ahead.

00:01:53.590 --> 00:01:54.913
- You are crazy.

00:01:57.350 --> 00:01:58.820
- You're a lucky guy.

00:01:58.820 --> 00:02:00.790
But when the luck runs
out, you gotta have a plan

00:02:00.790 --> 00:02:02.533
and you never have one.

00:02:02.533 --> 00:02:04.558
(dramatic music)

00:02:04.558 --> 00:02:07.143
- We will leave no one behind.

00:02:07.143 --> 00:02:08.479
(dramatic music)

00:02:08.479 --> 00:02:10.485
(man yelling)

00:02:10.485 --> 00:02:12.576
- [Woman] We're all
just refugees aren't we?

00:02:12.576 --> 00:02:15.674
(dramatic music)

00:02:15.674 --> 00:02:18.257
(somber music)

